# LF everywhere, on every checkout: the fixture file is sha256-pinned
# (declarative/machine/PINNING.md) and a CRLF conversion would silently
# change the digest; the WSL script must stay bash-readable; the
# .machine and .stzu fixtures accept CRLF by grammar but are born LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
